{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "443bec51-3d0b-8d52-b810-62b67127f19f",
  "created_at": "2026-02-20T10:48:16-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Rafael Castillo",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Lorraine Medeiros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-20T10:44:55-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Lorraine. Good morning, how can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-20T10:45:00-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good morning. Yes, hello. I need a new bin for the recycling. The one I have, it is broken."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-20T10:45:07-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, a replacement recycling bin. I can help with that. Can you tell me what happened to it? Is it cracked, or did it go missing?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-20T10:45:16-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It is cracked on the bottom. A big crack. And the wheel, one wheel is gone. The truck, I think, it dropped it hard."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-20T10:45:24-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright, so it's damaged. That happens. Let me get your address so I can put in the request. What's the address?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-20T10:45:32-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. It is 308 Van Zandt Avenue."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-20T10:45:35-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "308 Van Zandt Avenue. That's in the North End, correct?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-20T10:45:39-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, yes. North End."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-20T10:45:41-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Great. And can I have your name?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-20T10:45:44-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Rafael Castillo. Rafael, like it sounds. Castillo, C-A-S-T-I-L-L-O."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-20T10:45:48-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Rafael Castillo, C-A-S-T-I-L-L-O. Got it. Are you the owner of the home?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-20T10:45:53-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, I am the homeowner."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-20T10:45:56-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Perfect. Thank you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-20T10:45:58-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Excuse me, one question. Is there a fee for the new bin? I want to know before."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-20T10:46:04-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. Let me check on that for you. Hold on just a moment."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-20T10:46:09-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, I wait. Thank you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-20T10:46:12-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, I'm back. For a bin that's damaged, like a crack or a broken wheel, they generally replace it without a charge. A fee is more for extra bins or if one was lost. So yours should be a straight replacement."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-20T10:46:26-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So no fee. For mine, no fee. I understand this correct?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-20T10:46:30-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's right. For a damaged bin, no fee. If anything changes when the crew drops it off, they'd let us know. But I don't expect that."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-20T10:46:39-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Good. Thank you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-20T10:46:41-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Now, do you want the same size as the one you have, or a different size?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-20T10:46:47-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The same size. The one with the wheels, the blue one."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-20T10:46:51-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Same size, blue, with wheels. Okay. Do you want the crew to pick up the old broken one?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-20T10:46:58-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes please. I leave it by the street, near the pole. Is okay?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-20T10:47:03-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's fine. Leave it at the curb by the pole, and they'll swap it out. It usually takes a few days, maybe a week."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-20T10:47:11-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A week. Okay. Can you repeat the time again? Slowly, please."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-20T10:47:15-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Of course. A few days, up to about a week. So you may see it by next Friday."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-20T10:47:22-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, a few days to a week. Good. Sorry, my phone, it is for work. I am filling in at the front desk of a gym today, so I answer on the break."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-20T10:47:33-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem at all, I appreciate you taking the time. Is this number the best one to reach you if they have questions?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-20T10:47:41-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. It is 401-555-0162."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-20T10:47:43-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0162. Let me read it back. Four, zero, one, five, five, five, zero, one, six, two. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-20T10:47:50-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, correct. Very good."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-20T10:47:52-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright, Mr. Castillo, so I have a replacement blue recycling bin for 308 Van Zandt Avenue, no fee, and the old one gets picked up at the curb. Anything else I can help with?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-20T10:48:04-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that is all. Thank you very much for the help."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-20T10:48:08-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome. Have a good day, and good luck at the gym."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-20T10:48:13-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. You too. Goodbye."
    }
  ],
